# MusicCast player list — single source of truth for group.musiccast_players and automation triggers
# Rewritten by every network scan — edits are lost. Exclude players by long-pressing
# their tile in the Settings view, then reload Groups + Automations.
# NOTE: .include suffix (not .yaml) prevents HA package loader from treating this as a package definition
# Ships with the package as a placeholder. Your first network scan replaces it.
- media_player.musiccast_placeholder
